{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11587","headline":"自瀼西荆扉且移居东屯茅屋四首 二 · 杜甫","name":"自瀼西荆扉且移居东屯茅屋四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东屯复瀼西，一种住青溪。\n来往皆茅屋，淹留爲稻畦。\n市喧宜近利，林僻此无蹊。\n若访衰翁语，须令賸客迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}